---
args: { mechanisms: InterventionMechanism[], evidence: EvidencePage[] }
returns: ExperimentDecisionRule[]
---
For every assumption that can change which mechanism is selected or which dependent work begins, identify a feasible discriminating test from the supplied evidence and state positive, negative, and inconclusive consequences. Prefer the least costly credible test supported by the record. If no evidence describes a feasible test, preserve that uncertainty and do not invent one.
